<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's net forex reserves rose in April.</title>
<headline>Portugal's net forex reserves rose in April.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal's net foreign exchange reserves, including gold valued at market prices, rose 428 million dollars to $20.18 billion in April, the central bank said in its latest monthly review of the economy.</p>
<p>In the first four months of the year, reserves rose 254 million dollars.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
